# golden for tests/probes/world-save-load.bund
# captured by `cargo xtask golden` from reference/Bund via target/oracle
# normalised: id and stamp (F14), dict member order (F15), ANSI stripped
# verified: two oracle runs produced identical output
## exit
0
## output
probe: a lambda, an alias and two stacks, saved and loaded in one program
probe: load them back and use each one
probe: save.script needs a prior save, then load.script returns the text
probe: bootstrap loads the world and runs every stored script
probe: load appends, so @other now holds its values three times over
